        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 430, Fancy Beaded Knob with Matching Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia 430 Beaded Knob is decorated with a subtle hobnail design around the edges for a truly traditional look. The subtle beading on both the knob and the matching rose of this knobset add just enough elegant detailing to be at home amongst the fanciest décors or it can add a point of interest to simpler spaces. The Fancy Beaded Knob with Matching Rose is designed to be easy to install and will cover most existing 2-1/8 inch bore holes. The Fancy Beaded Door Knobset is available in 8 stunning finishes in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAll critical interior parts are made of brass. Tough, non-rusting materials are used throughout. All dimensions are standard to fit existing bores for easy replacement installations.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Beaded Door Knob with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 430 Fancy Beaded Knob with Beaded Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door knob on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door knob on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MHE-nickel-pinapple.jpg?v=1704354543\" width=\"600\" height=\"121\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Fancy Beaded Door Knobset",
                "description": "The Omnia 430 Beaded Knob is decorated with a subtle hobnail design around the edges for a truly traditional look. The subtle beading on both the knob and the matching rose of this knobset add just enough elegant detailing to be at home amongst the fanciest décors or it can add a point of interest to simpler spaces. The Fancy Beaded Knob with Matching Rose is designed to be easy to install and will cover most existing 2-1/8 inch bore holes. The Fancy Beaded Door Knobset is available in 8 stunning finishes in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Omnia 430 Door Knob Latchsets, OMN-430/00 omnia fancy beaded door knobs, Solid brass door knobs, Simple doorknobs, fancy latchsets, Omnia simple door latchsets, Omnia 430 solid brass door knobs, Omnia fancy door knobs, beaded knobs, classic knobs, traditional knobs, passage knobs, privacy knobs, OMN430/00 Omnia door knobs,"
